{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12206070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12206070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1220607001:1":{"text":"修复了！你真的……做到了！这……这一定是魔法吧！","source_cn":"修复了！你真的……做到了！这……这一定是魔法吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF644705C1F89B2C5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"修复了！你真的……做到了！这……这一定是魔法吧！","female":"修复了！你真的……做到了！这……这一定是魔法吧！","variant_male_record_index":"136005","variant_female_record_index":"136006","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1220607002:1":{"text":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最可爱的魔法师！","source_cn":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4868CE7434DAE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1220607002":{"text":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最可爱的魔法师！","source_cn":"你们……你们简直就是伊索米亚最伟大、最传奇、最英气、最可爱的魔法师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4868CE7434DAE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220607003:1":{"text":"不……你不清楚这对我来说有多重要……","source_cn":"不……你不清楚这对我来说有多重要……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE64F838771A30F75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不……你不清楚这对我来说有多重要……","female":"不……你不清楚这对我来说有多重要……","variant_male_record_index":"136008","variant_female_record_index":"136009","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220607005:1":{"text":"我的爸爸……是个经验丰富的舵手，他答应过我每年都会回来，也几乎没食言过。","source_cn":"我的爸爸……是个经验丰富的舵手，他答应过我每年都会回来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41A512B1D6DDC12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220607006:1":{"text":"在我很小的时候问过他，如果他找不到回家的路怎么办。","source_cn":"在我很小的时候问过他，如果他找不到回家的路怎么办。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1F96CDC91B3B63E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220607007:1":{"text":"他告诉我，只要看懂天上的星座，就永远不会迷路。","source_cn":"他告诉我，只要看懂天上的星座，就永远不会迷路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x924A0959F46179E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220607008:1":{"text":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","source_cn":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEC01CEC90AB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1220607008":{"text":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","source_cn":"但后来有一天，他掌舵的那艘船再也没回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DEC01CEC90AB8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220607009:1":{"text":"不不，没什么，我已经……不难过了。","source_cn":"不不，没什么，我已经……不难过了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D3E30F7E92152AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不不，没什么，我已经……不难过了。","female":"不不，没什么，我已经……不难过了。","variant_male_record_index":"136016","variant_female_record_index":"136017","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220607011:1":{"text":"所以，你画这张星座图式为了纪念你爸爸？","source_cn":"所以，你画这张星座图式为了纪念你爸爸？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC97DF586A95463F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220607012:1":{"text":"嗯，是的，但也是为了我的未来。","source_cn":"嗯，是的，但也是为了我的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C4C6BEF1D4D12A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220607013:1":{"text":"父亲遇难后，妈妈就像变了个人一样，不再愿意我成为一名舵手，不肯让我离家太远。","source_cn":"父亲遇难后，妈妈就像变了个人一样，不再愿意我成为一名舵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0ADFD79ADB1DD14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220607014:1":{"text":"其实，你妈妈只是害怕失去你……","source_cn":"其实，你妈妈只是害怕失去你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x277178AAFB31100B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220607015:1":{"text":"我明白，可我已经长大了，不能像个小孩子，缩在妈妈身边度过一生。","source_cn":"我明白，可我已经长大了，不能像个小孩子，缩在妈妈身边度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0004EF630FD45942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220607016:1":{"text":"我想要掌控自己的未来，就像舵手掌控船的方向！","source_cn":"我想要掌控自己的未来，就像舵手掌控船的方向！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B3B43D70BBDF31A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220607017:1":{"text":"决定了去哪里后就出航，有了收获就满载而归——只要看懂天上的星座，就永远不会迷路！","source_cn":"决定了去哪里后就出航，有了收获就满载而归——只要看懂天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7DB9E149636209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220607018:1":{"text":"决定自己未来的舵手——你一定能做到的！","source_cn":"决定自己未来的舵手——你一定能做到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40BEDF128CE2ECD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220607019:1":{"text":"我会的！谢谢你们，我该回去了。","source_cn":"我会的！谢谢你们，我该回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A45D2537FC3EBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220607020:1":{"text":"那个……我们以后还会再见面吗？","source_cn":"那个……我们以后还会再见面吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E49029FDF1E9553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:12206